      "start": 2.0,
      "end": 5.83,
      "text": "有些人，看得见另一个人间。",
      "speech_file": "/Users/caoyanzu/workspace/ai-video-creation-tools/production/2026-11-01-nuowang-trailer/media/v1-speech-2621902d33fe44ce942aad6e31ab93b9.mp3",
      "speech_duration": 3.65
    },
    {
      "start": 16.2,
      "end": 20.84,
      "text": "一个少年。一位七百年前的将军。",
      "speech_file": "/Users/caoyanzu/workspace/ai-video-creation-tools/production/2026-11-01-nuowang-trailer/media/v2-speech-9ea996e46f4b41749245b7277014a1d4.mp3",
      "speech_duration": 4.46
    },
    {
      "start": 31.5,
      "end": 37.87,
      "text": "六十年一会。每个人，都想赢回自己的愿望。",
      "speech_file": "/Users/caoyanzu/workspace/ai-video-creation-tools/production/2026-11-01-nuowang-trailer/media/v3-speech-a5d4a9fc2d314da2a2e762d12c99e8ff.mp3",
      "speech_duration": 6.19
    },
    {
      "start": 46.0,
      "end": 50.4,
      "text": "他最信任的人，也是他必须追上的人。",
      "speech_file": "/Users/caoyanzu/workspace/ai-video-creation-tools/production/2026-11-01-nuowang-trailer/media/v4-speech-25f42da4d37c4b0890071f4c0fb69b76.mp3",
      "speech_duration": 4.22
    },
    {
      "start": 61.0,
      "end": 66.68,
      "text": "若要守住人间，就不能放弃任何一个回家的愿望。",
      "speech_file": "/Users/caoyanzu/workspace/ai-video-creation-tools/production/2026-11-01-nuowang-trailer/media/v5-speech-06c8eab503434c91a48d853d05661075.mp3",
      "speech_duration": 5.5
    },
    {
      "start": 77.5,
      "end": 81.09,
      "text": "师兄，我想带你回家。",
      "speech_file": "/Users/caoyanzu/workspace/ai-video-creation-tools/production/2026-11-01-nuowang-trailer/media/v6-speech-1e65336863aa404887434f4fef639b3e.mp3",
